>>> 8 potions of holy water, a blessed potion of gain level (which I'm
>>> going to quaff once I level up normally to maximize its effect),
>>
>> Hmm.. - there are much better applications for those potions, for
>> characters who plan to ascend.
> 
> Wait, what? I know the applications for holy water, but what better
> application is there for potions of gain level?

Once you have a couple of healing and extra healing potions you can do
alchemy. There's "one" (sort of) recipe to obtain full healing potions.
For the recipe you should have a heap of potions of healing and extra
healing, one or two potions of speed, 1 or two potions of gain energy
or potions of gain level, and holy water. (We can provide the complete
recipe if you like to get spoiled.) An altar is also very helpful and
a fountain, to support the alchemy process.

