> On a related note, if you're as good at daggers as I am at the moment,
> is it worth it to wish for Magicbane? It is pretty powerful on its
> own, is an athame for quick Elbereth-ing, and gives MR when I wield
> it, thus allowing me to get a different kind of DSM that may be
> helpful.

Indeed worth a wish, if you ask me. (Though, personally, I generally
abstain from wishing for artifacts.) Just keep in mind that the number
of already generated artifacts should be sufficiently small so that the
wish can succeed with sufficient probability. This precondition may not
apply to your current game, so changes are high that you'll just waste
your wishes that way.

